<p nodeId="873593e9c67341f1b6a8749c01e66564"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)">希望添加开通支持新的业务空间，请联系wangyaliang进行配置。</span></p>
<km-note type="warning" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="52be6a0ab546495a9221ffce20cb9233">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="c37977125c4d4e2684bf6bc4e6e39347">一个空间开启erwa能力，标记规则 和 生效规则 是两个配置，要分别开启。如果只开启了生效规则的erwa能力，则标记规则依旧无法被erwa监控</p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<h1 nodeId="8befe0939ab64b0685f6514b1c1cbf69">二、名词解释</h1>
<p nodeId="359837a5538144cb8652e2ed2eec6711">告警监控：<span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"> </span><span color=" ">对网络运行的过程中出现的风险事件和状况进行监测和报告，告警指示这些事件和状况的结果</span></p>
<p nodeId="e518793a7d644257b1328c4c3efec3bf">告警维度：规则命中触发告警之后在告警明细中展示这些信息（后台也只记录这些信息）</p>
<p nodeId="a35c5f1166794e638c4f01efe157adfe">聚合时间：在该时间段之内命中规则仅触发告警一次，<span color="rgb(38, 38, 38)">不重复进行告警</span></p>
<p nodeId="7da1696b54a945c6bdab6fdade93394b">聚合维度：类似于SQL中的“groupby”，按照哪些字段进行聚合，在聚合时间之内所有风险在相同的聚合维度命中仅告出一次</p>
<p nodeId="181c6d9bd8bb4a79bf07bc94c79fd343">风险事件：注意区别于<a href="https://km.sankuai.com/page/1292077011" title="Tatooine事件" nodeId="7180bf9aaa55496f9ba85d86ea35422e">Tatooine事件</a>，erwa平台的风险事件含义是指：监控告警配置每次触发，都会产生的一个待用户关注的告警通知，同告警规则、同聚合维度、同聚合周期内的多次告出，都聚合在这个事件里，计风险次数。</p>
<h1 nodeId="560459c0e6aa4b799b801a90281cbe8a">三、操作指南</h1>
<h2 nodeId="9f11f0173b9844c4b2a8eab3f92a83bc">1.用户操作流程说明</h2>
<km-drawio src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/549078276/11182888556?contentType=0&amp;isNewContent=false" width="647" height="170" nodeId="b06d0ce2d14041758e8604cb28fae1be" />
<h2 nodeId="c44eb6e9ae274724b03a222c3a51c126">2.Quick Start</h2>
<km-video src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/549078276/564456120?contentType=1" name="屏幕录制2020-12-23 下午7.46.42.mov" size="33.60MB" width="0" height="0" nodeId="ada97d8ed6f94896851388af1aafc795" />
<p nodeId="1ee97bce1b5b4ca28d15ef1d69fb12fb" />
<h2 nodeId="1b59c556c6a04cf4b3b1f7446ae8bd0a">3.详细操作流程说明</h2>
<km-note type="info" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="f717f3e0cd634d4fbc3dbd2a698fad1f">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="5c245735c7bb4fae8d444ff1c8ef39a0"><span color=" ">原Erwa平台新建告警配置中的【Zeus实时】数据源，已于2022.11.1正式下线，实时数据源统一收口至【zeus-rpc】。对于实时规则的监控，请统一于zeus场景配置后方操作栏入口进行配置。</span></p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<table borderColor="#cccccc" responsive="false" nodeId="03cc36d9d24c4c03a3e758b6382f1172">
<tr nodeId="623651b4cc8f403f914542c38ec9f001">
<td colspan="2" colwidth="[579,761]" bgColor="rgb(247, 247, 247)" nodeId="f1f9d14b4f8648cc9da7c2c9a0007f7d">
<h3 nodeId="8ff56e39f405446f953b5bb8197b9fba"><span font-size="14">Step1: 配置入口</span></h3>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="e65981e4afd34a07abd187a33ae84e59">
<td colwidth="[579]" nodeId="beba0cd78d5f49aba3524d15880ad45a">
<p nodeId="65b5a14f78d24e408eb38bf03c8d7b0e"><span font-size="14">入口：</span></p>
<p nodeId="9fd3f107286041df8197f5db262d8594"><span font-size="14">点击场景--&gt;场景配置--&gt;选择目标场景配置</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[761]" nodeId="168496d381c941b58ca0a292a2d1f4bb">
<p nodeId="f2e5744d47534a32a35afdae4c2c8653"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/549078276/564476170?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="739" height="295" nodeId="7f45b281ed364453a882a177e4b2ecb5" /></p>
<p nodeId="552086464faa41a3a17a3ac7e1c43043" />
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="c667ae80077e4df68bb88f348ab78b9a">
<td colspan="2" colwidth="[579,761]" bgColor="rgb(247, 247, 247)" nodeId="e1154a26f6da464eaf14ef63e54ca562">
<h3 nodeId="cf401767c11d49de8419c26cc3830228"><span font-size="14">Step2: 配置监控</span></h3>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="dbc6c8185e274f8496011d0631455af3">
<td colwidth="[579]" nodeId="b07e50f6fe6640f09d432be7673b8f4d">
<p nodeId="01d4b304fdd647e28ef361607e947767"><span font-size="14">1.点击“配置监控”；</span></p>
<p nodeId="8d7ebb3b17084301a4303853b42532de"><span font-size="14">2.填写监控项配置内容并保存；</span></p>
<km-note type="note" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="0059ecb5bcf340ecbfb0aa1b4d2f59ab">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="ae9c5e9b5a334ed28507b403ef5f9410"><span font-size="14">通过Zeus入口配置监控后，会自动在Erwa告警平台生成一条监控告警配置（ID在zeus展开抽屉中可见）；其中，默认的监控逻辑为「该条场景配置的命中」，例：include(string.split(hitRules,','),55938)，55938即为zeus规则id。</span></p>
<p nodeId="18b96f735bdc4a518321cdfeb81b2aab"><span font-size="14">注意，该表达式隐含了</span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="14">场景、决策</span></span><span font-size="14">信息，即实际效果是该【场景-规则-决策】每当有命中数据，erwa就会结合聚合维度与聚合时间，决定是否告出。</span></p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="f34ae0e7b68b4fb6bc13031a91dcb2f7">
<tr nodeId="2fc3fa803cf54eb9bb41cfffc7822980">
<th colwidth="[92]" nodeId="e2af1069f5fa40ab9a9e5737d1c0e425">
<p nodeId="0400e263e604468bb57e1872d6f0c056"><span font-size="14">项</span></p>
</th>
<th colspan="2" colwidth="[92,376]" nodeId="266d8d4091a74ae8bbad6c5e7a06c4c5">
<p nodeId="d3f5f35729c34137a17f370e6703eb09"><span font-size="14">说明</span></p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="0baa07d9fb834ed883699e25adeacc3f">
<td colwidth="[92]" nodeId="ec0639ac921440c68d0624c9e29dd7f9">
<p nodeId="e3c3ef33c2d240fe9c9c76b8b68a48d9"><span font-size="14">告警维度</span></p>
<p nodeId="f15cbcaba0b349bca32645ba8f2485c3"><span font-size="14">（</span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="14">必填</span></span><span font-size="14">）</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="2" colwidth="[92,376]" nodeId="c53e9907a75d4077813240efdf03f5fd">
<ul nodeId="a6c2a2f249c94f0d9e5c04036a3a405f">
<li nodeId="7772c09010d24f549f6a06308b23c6e7"><span color="rgb(38, 38, 38)"><span font-size="14">添加后会在</span></span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="14">告警明细</span></span><span color="rgb(38, 38, 38)"><span font-size="14">中展示这些信息</span></span></li>
<li nodeId="ffc94ce2ac434ab2b2cda3c66f4df0dd"><span color="rgb(38, 38, 38)"><span font-size="14">自输入，可添加多个。</span></span><span color="rgb(29, 57, 196)"><span font-size="14">注：输入字段后需要回车一下才能保存</span></span></li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="6ec6b617a34a4689acd51dc246d53eca">
<td colwidth="[92]" nodeId="41a86b151c3b44548efb9c0f95a40764">
<p nodeId="5bb619285e5542c795c947d8bdff4712"><span font-size="14">聚合时间</span><br /><span font-size="14">（非必填）</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="2" colwidth="[92,376]" nodeId="e6f683ad69154d2192d0e0b545973839">
<ul nodeId="36a799aeff8d432caf44ee7be1645099">
<li nodeId="3d72d809b1014a3793d2f83980d7b9c5"><span font-size="14">在该时间段之内命中规则仅触发告警一次</span><span color="rgb(0, 0, 0)"><span font-size="14">，</span></span><span color="rgb(38, 38, 38)"><span font-size="14">不重复进行告警</span></span></li>
<li nodeId="6f9737b9b9d24558b7b6864146139062"><span color="rgb(38, 38, 38)"><span font-size="14">支持时间段：</span></span><span font-size="14">无、</span><span color="rgb(38, 38, 38)"><span font-size="14">15min、30min、1h、6h、12h、24h</span></span></li>
<li nodeId="927a59e319b84a198103d976ba1202ef"><span font-size="14">说明：</span><span color=" "><span font-size="14">如果选“无”，</span></span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="14">命中即发送告警消息</span></span><span color=" "><span font-size="14">，没有上限</span></span></li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="a2e5d1b90ce64e5593f2d41b88b8d24f">
<td colwidth="[92]" nodeId="4cdbf2e46a0a4a329e561fb2a80f8538">
<p nodeId="2a5522868dc2475bbd06e6de7e198b58"><span font-size="14">聚合维度</span><br /><span font-size="14">（</span><span color="rgb(38, 38, 38)"><span font-size="14">非必填</span></span><span font-size="14">）</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="2" colwidth="[92,376]" nodeId="97305b7ea44e4aba93af6c62b4b283cb">
<ul nodeId="1ec4007582294ad6ae4a6f1f86e85b60">
<li nodeId="4a1fe039a4fe4125b8de246c41e2863e"><span font-size="14">类似于SQL中的”groupby“，按照哪些字段进行聚合。在聚合时间之内，相同的聚合维度命中仅告出一次，其余会计风险次数。</span></li>
<li nodeId="8441664284cf45529bdff04cd47b7c30"><span color="rgb(38, 38, 38)"><span font-size="14">支持自输入多个维度，注：输入字段后需要</span></span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="14">回车一下才能保存</span></span></li>
<li nodeId="014b3ad42d0e4929924be9aeb779c113"><span color="rgb(29, 57, 196)"><span font-size="14">说明：聚合维度必须是告警维度的子集（因为后台仅记录告警维度这些信息，如果聚合维度不在告警维度之内的话无法进行聚合）</span></span></li>
</ul>
<km-note type="warning" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="7fc67b40aaaf46d9a9598a9814a296b4">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="ac17425914244f94bed5cf85f11d41e0"><span color="rgb(38, 38, 38)"><span font-size="14">对应聚合时间内，同聚合维度，仅首次触发会发送告警通知，后续触发都计风险次数；</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="ce501baac81344e6a846577e57f0c421"><span color="rgb(38, 38, 38)"><span font-size="14">24小时之内，对应聚合时间内，同感知规则id、同聚合维度只算一个风险事件，风险列表内仅展示一项，同时记录对应的触发次数作为风险次数，24小时之后会重新创建风险事件</span></span></p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="5caaa2b3856242fd88d48404a1d5f7a6">
<td rowspan="4" colwidth="[92]" nodeId="9f54a9aa82314479b110b8c4d59ee589">
<p nodeId="f234ee2710cc44839fdfbc1f482a2908"><span font-size="14">告警通知</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[92]" nodeId="3c8238e493464a27a7c650ba89612ddf">
<p nodeId="126fa627dc05403ba1a5a22fdb570966"><span font-size="14">优先级</span><br /><span color="rgb(0, 0, 0)"><span font-size="14">（</span></span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="14">必填</span></span><span color="rgb(0, 0, 0)"><span font-size="14">）</span></span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[376]" nodeId="6f9bedd254ca43a7a5db4c19cae5c1a2">
<ul nodeId="ab1291970288498489fadce55ded2d81">
<li nodeId="2fdcf1b9fffd4655a26d2cfcb7fd0f39"><span color=" "><span font-size="14">这里配置的优先级起到通知展示作用，给业务查看</span></span></li>
<li nodeId="8f5b1ce2bdf84047b14ea9e505c62d3c"><span color=" "><span font-size="14">可以配置 P0/P1/P2/P3，优先级逐渐降低</span></span></li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="5e9f20a100e845bab9b62737e432edb9">
